  <notes><![CDATA[
Completed 2026-07-03. Deployed to spaarkedev1:
  - Webresource sprk_regardingrecordnumber_hyperlink v1.0.0 created + published
    (webresourceid d09bc028-2477-f111-ab0e-70a8a590c51c, type=3 JScript,
    unmanaged).
  - sprk_todo main form (formid eca59df4-1364-f111-ab0c-7ced8ddc4cc6) PATCHed:
      * FormXml: REGARDING section row 2/3 reconfigured to single row
        [sprk_regardingrecordnumber colspan=1 disabled=true |
         sprk_regardingrecordname colspan=2 disabled=true]; sprk_regardingrecordurl
        relocated to hidden cell (persistence preserved).
      * FormXml: <events> + <formLibraries> added. OnLoad handler wires
        Spaarke.SmartTodo.RegardingRecordNumberHyperlink.onLoad with
        passExecutionContext=true.
  - sprk_todo entity published.

Verification (via verify-form-events.ps1 against spaarkedev1):
  - formxml size 18862 chars (was 18356)
  - formjson regenerated to 71671 chars
  - All 8 markers pass: webresource + handler in formxml; events block present;
    formLibraries present; both field disabled=true markers present;
    formjson regenerated contains both webresource + handler references.

Two implementation discoveries:
  1. formjson is READ-ONLY — Dataverse regenerates it from formxml on
     publish. Initial approach that PATCH'd formjson directly was ignored
     (no error, but no persistence). Fix: modify formxml <events> block
     instead; formjson regenerates automatically.
  2. FormXml XSD schema rejects unrecognized attributes on <row> etc.
     Idempotency markers must be intrinsic (e.g. disabled="true" on the
     new-shape field) rather than custom xmlns:sprk-style attributes.

